G04    value is CANNOT DETERMINE.*
G04 4. U1 (nRF52832 WLCSP-50) has NO LAND PATTERN - the ball map is CANNOT*
G04    DETERMINE. U2 (Apple U1 UWB) is UNPOPULATED and has none either.*
G04 5. The outer diameter is a BOUND, 24.95-26.34 mm. The drawn value is*
G04    not a settled diameter, and if it moves it moves DOWN.*
